# Grok + Cursor together

`cursor.pairing: together` is the default.

- Grok inference (LangChain / xAI SDK / Vercel): chat, tools, Responses API. `XAI_API_KEY`.
- Cursor SDK: local/cloud agents, workspace. `CURSOR_API_KEY`. Model = Grok from `Cursor.models.list()`.
- One LangSmith project traces both.
- Opt-out is explicit (`grok-only` or `cursor-only`). Do not invent exclusivity.
